        "original_id": "aded3805-d026-5b25-98e4-9c93e5dbf6be",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Scarlet Letter (1995 film)\n- People: Roland Joffé, Demi Moore, Gary Oldman, Robert Duvall, Andrew G. Vajna, Mario Kassar\n- Companies: Cinergi Pictures, C2 Pictures, Carolco Pictures\n- Topics: Gary Oldman career\n\nFacts:\n- Gary Oldman was born on 21 March 1958.\n- Gary Oldman is an English actor, filmmaker, musician, and author who has worked in theatre, film, and television.\n- The Scarlet Letter is a 1995 American romantic drama film.\n- The Scarlet Letter was directed by Roland Joffé and stars Demi Moore, Gary Oldman, and Robert Duvall.\n- Cinergi Pictures suffered a string of box office bombs including The Scarlet Letter and closed in 1998.\n- In 2002, Andrew G. Vajna, who had formed Cinergi Pictures before it folded in 1998, and Mario Kassar started the film company C2 Pictures.\n- Andrew G. Vajna and Mario Kassar were co-founders of Carolco Pictures.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
